  "overview": "**Dell Design System** is a light-first design system anchored on `#ffffff` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.7:1 contrast) and `#ff99a1` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `Roboto` (72px display down to 16px body), unified by `4px` base corner radius and stepped `#ffffff` -> `#ffebf5` surface layering.\n\nMaintained by **Dell**. Source: live stylesheet extraction (https://www.delldesignsystem.com/). Inventory: **91** colors, **20** typography steps, and **11** documented components (all rights reserved license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 11 component tokens with documented paddings: `8px 12px`, `2px`, `6px 12px`, `12px 14px`, `6px 10px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#ffebf5` cards; separate sibling sections using `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Surface & Stroke Elevation**: Relies on crisp tonal contrast (`#ffffff` -> `#ffebf5`) and `1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines instead of heavy drop shadows.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#ff99a1` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#ffffff` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#ff99a1` with `#0b0b0c` text (9.7:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `Roboto` headings with `Roboto` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `4px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (0.25rem on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#ffebf5` surface shifts and `color-mix(in srgb, #0b0b0c 14%, transparent)` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `4px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `input` fields and secondary buttons."
